<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
html { background: #ffffff; }
body {
  width: 720pt; height: 405pt; margin: 0; padding: 0;
  background: #F4F6F6;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  display: flex;
}
.header {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
  height: 70pt;
  background: #1C2833;
  padding: 20pt 40pt;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.header h1 {
  font-size: 28pt;
  color: #F4F6F6;
  margin: 0;
}
.content {
  position: absolute;
  top: 70pt; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
  padding: 25pt 40pt 50pt 40pt;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.layout {
  display: flex;
  gap: 25pt;
  height: 100%;
}
.left {
  flex: 1;
}
.right {
  flex: 1;
}
.card {
  background: #ffffff;
  border-left: 6pt solid #4472C4;
  border-radius: 8pt;
  padding: 12pt;
  margin-bottom: 12pt;
  box-shadow: 0 2pt 6pt rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}
.card h2 {
  font-size: 14pt;
  color: #1C2833;
  margin: 0 0 6pt 0;
  font-weight: bold;
}
.card ul {
  margin: 0;
  padding-left: 18pt;
  font-size: 11pt;
  color: #2E4053;
  line-height: 1.4;
}
.card p {
  font-size: 11pt;
  color: #2E4053;
  margin: 0;
  line-height: 1.4;
}
.highlight {
  background: #4472C4;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  padding: 10pt 12pt;
  border-radius: 8pt;
  margin-top: 8pt;
}
.highlight p {
  font-size: 11pt;
  margin: 0;
  font-weight: bold;
  text-align: center;
}
.chart-container {
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 10pt;
  padding: 15pt;
  box-shadow: 0 2pt 8pt rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  height: 100%;
}
.chart-container h3 {
  font-size: 14pt;
  color: #1C2833;
  margin: 0 0 10pt 0;
  font-weight: bold;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header">
  <h1>科技：AI 2.0 商业化元年</h1>
</div>
<div class="content">
  <div class="layout">
    <div class="left">
      <div class="card">
        <h2>🚀 核心驱动</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>大模型应用加速落地，从Demo走向商业化</li>
          <li>算力需求持续高景气，GPU/ASIC芯片供不应求</li>
          <li>AI+千行百业，生产力革命正式开启</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h2>🎯 关注热点</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><b>光通信</b>：数据中心扩容，400G/800G光模块需求激增</li>
          <li><b>智谱AI</b>：国内大模型龙头，IPO预期强烈</li>
          <li><b>算力租赁</b>：云厂商加码AI算力投资</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="highlight">
        <p>💡 投资策略：关注具备核心技术壁垒的龙头公司，关注AI应用落地进度</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="right">
      <div class="chart-container" id="ai-chart" class="placeholder" style="width: 100%; height: 100%;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
